{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12342","headline":"哭常徴君 · 钱起","name":"哭常徴君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万化一朝尽，穷泉悲此君。\n如何丹竈术，能误紫芝焚。\n不遂苍生望，空留封禅文。\n远年随逝水，真气尽浮云。\n山闭龙蛇蛰，林寒麋鹿羣。\n伤心载酒地，仙菊爲谁薰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}